From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:02:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter/vf_zscale: keep the light levels when linearising

A transfer change drops all colour-dependent side data. When the output
is linear light in the same primaries, the content light level and the
mastering display still describe the frame, and a tone mapper further
down the graph reads its peak from them; without them vf_tonemap falls
back to a fixed peak. Keep those two in that case and drop the other
colour-dependent side data as before.

The test runs zscale on a PQ BT.2020 frame with light levels and an ICC
profile, and checks which side data survive a change to linear, a
change of primaries, a change to BT.709 and a plain resize.

Signed-off-by: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
---
 libavfilter/Makefile                      |   2 +-
 libavfilter/tests/zscale_light_levels.c   | 138 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 libavfilter/vf_zscale.c                   |  44 ++++++-
 tests/fate/filter-video.mak               |   4 +
 tests/ref/fate/filter-zscale-light-levels |   4 +
 5 files changed, 185 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 libavfilter/tests/zscale_light_levels.c
 create mode 100644 tests/ref/fate/filter-zscale-light-levels

diff --git a/libavfilter/Makefile b/libavfilter/Makefile
index 7066597b2f5dbd532827536ca879850595cf16b9..a2805605a15bbc934e6da2bb1ee780675c9d024d 100644
--- a/libavfilter/Makefile
+++ b/libavfilter/Makefile
@@ -683,7 +683,7 @@ SKIPHEADERS-$(CONFIG_VULKAN)                 += vulkan_filter.h
 SKIPHEADERS-$(CONFIG_SCALE_CUDA_FILTER)      += vf_scale_cuda.h
 
 TOOLS     = graph2dot
-TESTPROGS = bt2408_hable dovi_reshape drawutils filtfmts formats integral
+TESTPROGS = bt2408_hable dovi_reshape drawutils filtfmts formats integral zscale_light_levels
 
 TESTPROGS-$(CONFIG_DRAWVG_FILTER) += drawvg
 
diff --git a/libavfilter/tests/zscale_light_levels.c b/libavfilter/tests/zscale_light_levels.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..3eda0579424155209e1c8ea1af00813e09303210
--- /dev/null
+++ b/libavfilter/tests/zscale_light_levels.c
@@ -0,0 +1,138 @@
